# Reactive Surface 50 Character Profile Smoke - 2026-07-05

## Scope

Purpose: validate the implementation shape where a player-side reactive controller collects nearby character-mounted components, selects the nearest 20 of 50 candidates, pushes a Niagara runtime Array DI, writes to RT, and leaves Unreal Insights/ProfileGPU evidence.

Runner:

- `codex/scripts/reactive_surface/reactive_surface_50_agent_insights_runner.py`

Fixture rules:

- Temp content only: `/Game/_MCP_Temp/NiagaraGenerated/ReactiveGhost_50Load`
- Character class: `/Game/ThirdPerson/Blueprints/BP_Piper.BP_Piper_C`
- Character count: 50 placed temp-map actors
- Candidate component source: each temp character actor's tagged root component
- Selection: nearest 20 to RT center `[256, 256]`
- RT: RGBA16F, 512x512, UAV enabled where exposed
- Cleanup audit: temp root deleted, dirty package count 0

